<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Resumen consolidado - ansible-sles-upgrade</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 2rem; color: #1a1a1a; background: #fafafa; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-top: 1rem; background: #fff; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem; text-align: left; font-size: 0.92rem; }
  th { background: #f0f0f0; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #fff; }
  .badge-OK { background: #2e7d32; }
  .badge-WARNING { background: #b8860b; }
  .badge-FAILED { background: #c62828; }
  .badge-NOT_CHECKED { background: #757575; }
  .muted { color: #777; font-size: 0.85rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Resumen consolidado de ejecución — ansible-sles-upgrade</h1>
<p class="muted">Generado: {{ resumen_generated_at }}. Muestra el último estado conocido por host y etapa (leído de run_summary.jsonl).</p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Host</th><th>Etapa</th><th>Acción</th><th>Estado</th><th>Fecha/hora</th><th>Reporte detallado</th></tr>
  {% for e in resumen_entries %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ e.hostname }}</td>
    <td>{{ e.stage }}</td>
    <td>{{ e.action }}</td>
    <td><span class="badge badge-{{ e.status }}">{{ e.status }}</span></td>
    <td>{{ e.timestamp }}</td>
    <td><code>{{ e.report_html }}</code></td>
  </tr>
  {% else %}
  <tr><td colspan="6" class="muted">Sin registros todavía en run_summary.jsonl</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>

<p class="muted">Generado automáticamente por ansible-sles-upgrade. No contiene secretos.</p>

</body>
</html>
